    509592464
   ],
   "actor": "Mura",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "H–hey… you’re not one of her assistants, are you? Please… don’t leave.",
   "settings": {
    "m_HideUnavailable": false,
    "m_HideVisited": false,
    "m_SkipChoice": false,
    "m_ShuffleChoices": false,
    "m_TimedChoice": {
     "m_TimedChoice": false,
     "m_Duration": {
      "kind": "value",
      "value": 10
     },
     "m_Timeout": "ChooseRandom"
    },
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1273735527": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 528224766,
   "children": [
    536083308,
    -942482422
   ],
   "actor": null,
   "text": "I work with her. Why are you locked up?",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "536083308": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1273735527,
   "actor": "Mura",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Then you already know she’s a goddamn maniac. I was her partner.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "178849838": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 528224766,
   "children": [
    833537285,
    835854667
   ],
   "actor": null,
   "text": "Jesus, what the hell did she do to you?",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "833537285": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 178849838,
   "actor": "Mura",
   "expression": 4,
   "text": "You’re right to ask. She’s lost her fucking mind. I’m Dr. Mura.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "509592464": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 528224766,
   "children": [
    2097611685,
    892947146
   ],
   "actor": null,
   "text": "Easy. Who are you and what’s going on here?",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "2097611685": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 509592464,
   "actor": "Mura",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Name’s Dr. Mura. I worked with Evelyn Frost before she went off the rails. Said she wanted to “merge desire and biology.”",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "134361379": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "Mura",
   "expression": 2,
   "text": "There’s a control panel somewhere deeper in the lab. It’s locked to her biometrics, but you look like you can move around without getting tagged.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1878236622": {
   "kind": "choice",
   "parent": -1,
   "children": [
    -1098924292,
    753661643,
    1952301977
   ],
   "actor": "Mura",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Find a way to override it. Don’t touch the console here or it’ll fry me.",
   "settings": {
    "m_HideUnavailable": false,
    "m_HideVisited": false,
    "m_SkipChoice": false,
    "m_ShuffleChoices": false,
    "m_TimedChoice": {
     "m_TimedChoice": false,
     "m_Duration": {
      "kind": "value",
      "value": 10
     },
     "m_Timeout": "ChooseRandom"
    },
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1098924292": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1878236622,
   "children": [
    -246076224,
    406353460
   ],
   "actor": null,
   "text": "Why should I help you? She’s making progress.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-246076224": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1098924292,
   "actor": "Mura",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Progress? She’s breeding monsters, splicing hormones with arousal chemicals, using her own fucking patients as test subjects.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "753661643": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1878236622,
   "children": [
    -806972655,
    795819740
   ],
   "actor": null,
   "text": "I’ll find that control and shut this nightmare down.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-806972655": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 753661643,
   "actor": "Mura",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Thank you. Find the override and I’m gone.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1952301977": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1878236622,
   "children": [
    -508710747,
    351941451
   ],
   "actor": null,
   "text": "If I’m gonna risk this, I need to know what I’m walking into.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-508710747": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 1952301977,
   "actor": "Mura",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "She calls them “hybrids.” Human essence rewired and... Fuck, what else do you need to hear?",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-226651364": {
   "kind": "choice",
   "parent": -1,
   "children": [
    -1157667448,
    640358829,
    -872208652
   ],
   "actor": "Mura",
   "expression": 4,
   "text": "Please. Before she realizes you’ve been in here. If she catches us talking, she’ll turn me into one of her pets and start over on you.",
   "settings": {
    "m_HideUnavailable": false,
    "m_HideVisited": false,
    "m_SkipChoice": false,
    "m_ShuffleChoices": false,
    "m_TimedChoice": {
     "m_TimedChoice": false,
     "m_Duration": {
      "kind": "value",
      "value": 10
     },
     "m_Timeout": "ChooseRandom"
    },
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1157667448": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -226651364,
   "children": [
    -1684921690
   ],
   "actor": null,
   "text": "You’re insane. Evelyn knows what she's doing.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1684921690": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1157667448,
   "actor": "Mura",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Keep worshiping your ice queen. When she’s finished with you, maybe she’ll bottle what’s left and call it enlightenment.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "640358829": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -226651364,
   "children": [
    485142095
   ],
   "actor": null,
   "text": "Hang in there. I’ll find a way to free you.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "485142095": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 640358829,
   "actor": "Mura",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Go. Free me before she finishes whatever she’s building. If you see a chamber marked “Euphoria Engine,” stay away. It’s not what it sounds like.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   },
